날씨각 2026-11-12 메일 '[공유]날씨각 지역 주소 목록' — 날씨각 홈은 보는 사람 위치의 날씨를 보여
지역각에서는 https://weather.o2o.kr/today/{path}를 쓴다. 군산 path는 날씨각 sitemap에서 확인.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Vhf1SzcdSAwnkfrs9wbu8Z
---
 pipeline/present.py          | 13 +++++++++----
 templates/_side.html.j2      |  2 +-
 tests/test_sidebar_layout.py | 11 ++++++-----
 3 files changed, 16 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

diff --git a/pipeline/present.py b/pipeline/present.py
index 81371e94f3..f9cfef8406 100644
--- a/pipeline/present.py
+++ b/pipeline/present.py
@@ -5271,19 +5271,24 @@ def page_chrome(page_kind: str, has_courses: bool) -> dict:
 WEATHER_FEED = "https://weather.o2o.kr/v1/feed?region={code}"
 WEATHER_API = "https://weather.o2o.kr/v1/weather/today?region={code}"
 WEATHER_HOME = "https://weather.o2o.kr/"
-WEATHER_REGIONS = {"군산": "5213000000"}   # 행정표준코드 전북 군산시
+# '자세히 보기' opens 날씨각's page of the region, not its home (날씨각 2026-11-12 메일 '[공유]날씨각 지역 주소 목록': the
+# home shows the reader's own location; 대표님 — the ○○각 region's weather): https://weather.o2o.kr/today/{path}, path
+# from 날씨각's region list (its sitemap has the same pages; /today/jeonbuk/gunsan is '군산시 오늘 날씨', region 5213000000)
+WEATHER_PAGE = "https://weather.o2o.kr/today/{path}"
+WEATHER_REGIONS = {"군산": ("5213000000", "jeonbuk/gunsan")}   # (행정표준코드, 날씨각 path) 전북 군산시
 
 
 def weather_vm(region_ko: str, code: str, region_label: str) -> dict | None:
     """The weather card's hook ({feed, api, home, title, go, js}) in one version, or None for a region 날씨각 has no
-    code for. js: the words weather.js draws with (more, score, slots, feels, hum, sky), the version's language (its
+    code for. home: the region's own 날씨각 page (WEATHER_PAGE) — '자세히 보기'. js: the words weather.js draws with (more, score, slots, feels, hum, sky), the version's language (its
     date) and ko (the Korean pages show 날씨각's own sentences — bubble, summary, status; the other versions the score,
     the figures, the icons and the cells' names in their words)."""
-    rc = WEATHER_REGIONS.get(region_ko or "")
+    rc, path = WEATHER_REGIONS.get(region_ko or "") or ("", "")
     if not rc:
         return None
     w = LC.SIDE_WORDS[code]
-    return {"feed": WEATHER_FEED.format(code=rc), "api": WEATHER_API.format(code=rc), "home": WEATHER_HOME,
+    return {"feed": WEATHER_FEED.format(code=rc), "api": WEATHER_API.format(code=rc),
+            "home": WEATHER_PAGE.format(path=path) if path else WEATHER_HOME,
             "title": w["wx_title"].format(r=region_label), "go": w["wx_go"].format(r=region_label),
             "js": {"more": w["wx_more"], "score": w["wx_score"], "slots": w["wx_slots"], "feels": w["wx_feels"],
                    "hum": w["wx_hum"], "sky": w["sky"], "lang": "ko" if code == "ko" else LC.get(code).html,
diff --git a/templates/_side.html.j2 b/templates/_side.html.j2
index b675a98e3f..cc6909db81 100644
--- a/templates/_side.html.j2
+++ b/templates/_side.html.j2
@@ -20,7 +20,7 @@
     weather(wx, variant): 날씨각's own first-screen card (operator 2026-10-31 '날씨각 실제 디자인으로'), 'home' (the
       homes, under the first screen: the card as 날씨각 draws it) or 'side' (the panel: the same card, small — the sun or
       moon with the score, the bubble, the four cells). The HTML holds no weather value: the card's name and the link
-      to weather.o2o.kr ('군산 날씨 보기' — no source words: 날씨각 is the operator's), which is all a reader without
+      to the region's 날씨각 page (weather.o2o.kr/today/<path>, present.WEATHER_PAGE; '군산 날씨 보기' — no source words: 날씨각 is the operator's), which is all a reader without
       JavaScript (or after a failed or late answer) gets. assets/weather.js (site.js attaches it after the page has
       loaded, when a card is on screen) asks the feed (data-wx) and the day's slots (data-wx-day) and draws the card
       in the room css/80-side.css keeps for it; the drawn card is one link (its 자세히 보기 covers it). -#}
